            "paragraph": "This could be due to extremes in phenomena which drive shorter-timescale variations, such as the Quasi-Biennial Oscillation (QBO; Baldwin et al., 2001), El Ni\u00f1o-Southern Oscillation (ENSO; Br\u00f6nnimann, 2007) and the 11-year solar cycle (Gray et al., 2016), and their interactions (Labitzke and Kunze, 2009). In addition, the rare chance that weather conditions conducive to extreme events also hit large exposure centres can affect multidecadal-mean losses.",
